{"path":"coroutine/generator/promise_type/operator_delete","title":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::promise_type::operator delete","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">generator&lt;Ref,V,Allocator&gt;::promise_type::</span>operator delete","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type/operator_delete","section":"coroutine","kind":"page","summary":"Deallocates the storage pointed to by ptr using an allocator equivalent to that used to allocate this memory.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/new/operator_delete\"><span class=\"kw694\">operator delete</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> ptr, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> n <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Deallocates the storage pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ptr</span></code> using an allocator equivalent to that used to <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type/operator_new\">allocate</a> this memory.\n</p><p>The <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ptr</span></code> passed to this function must be the one returned from an invocation of one of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type/operator_new\"><code>operator new</code></a> overloads with a size argument equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code>. Otherwise the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ptr\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a pointer obtained from the previous call to <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/promise_type/operator_new\"><code>operator new</code></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the size of the storage to be deallocated\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"coroutine","title":"Coroutine support (C++20)"},{"path":"coroutine/generator","title":"std::generator"},{"path":"coroutine/generator/promise_type","title":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::promise_type"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::promise_type::operator delete","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Deallocates the storage pointed to by ptr using an allocator equivalent to that used to allocate this memory."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ptr, n"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":85,"codeBlockCount":0}
